{"id":"n66370-2-7","stage":1,"title":"사고 · 祸事","scene":"犯错与处罚","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66370-2-7-1","ko":"무슨 사고를 쳤길래 또 벌을 서는 거야?","zh":"你又闯什么祸了，怎么又在罚站？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"사고를","meaning":"祸、麻烦","explanation":"사고를 치다 是固定说法，表示“闯祸、惹出麻烦”；这里不是交通事故。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"2","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사고를","audio":"/audio/56f8e1f5684c2cd70aa0.mp3"}},{"text":"쳤길래","meaning":"闯了（祸）","explanation":"치다 与 사고 合用表示“闯祸”；-었- 表示过去，-길래 引出根据所见情况提出的疑问。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"22","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쳤길래","audio":"/audio/4366663e349298023fda.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又。","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"벌을","meaning":"惩罚，罚","explanation":"벌：惩罚，罚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"벌","audio":"/audio/e96cb3184b4bef0751d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14450","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌을","audio":"/audio/c121ffdb032423ef306f.mp3"}},{"text":"서는","meaning":"站着、罚站","explanation":"서다：站；벌을 서다 在这里指“罚站”；-는 修饰后面的 거。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68756","senseId":"1","lemma":"서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서는","audio":"/audio/d92aa6ed68a45f5dfa85.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"是怎么回事？","explanation":"-는 거야? 用非敬语追问眼前的情况，整句是在问为何又被罚站。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"祸事、麻烦","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3","entryId":"66370","definition":"造成损害或问题的坏事；사고를 치다 表示“闯祸”。","pronunciation":["사ː고"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"闯祸（与 사고 合用）","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"사고를 치다 是“闯祸、惹麻烦”的固定搭配。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"e96cb3184b4bef07","term":"벌","zh":"惩罚，罚","audio":"/audio/e96cb3184b4bef0751d0.mp3","entryId":"14450","definition":"作为犯错或犯罪的代价而遭受的痛苦。","pronunciation":["벌"]},{"id":"4fccaaf883d3c239","term":"서다","zh":"站、罚站","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3","entryId":"68756","definition":"把身体直立站着；벌을 서다 在本句指罚站。","pronunciation":["서다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"事、情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"依存名词 것 的口语形式；这里指前面“又罚站”的情况。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d8b1bc0a79b7ecdb54d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66370-2-7-2","ko":"야구를 하다가 유리창을 깼어요.","zh":"打棒球时打破玻璃窗了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야구를","meaning":"棒球","explanation":"야구：棒球；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"야구","audio":"/audio/7403c43735a4108cd9f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62512","senseId":"1","lemma":"야구","origin":"NIKL Kore